(6640761, 991247, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''ve always liked this theme, I shoot models often and I hope to do a shoot just like this sometime this year. The setting works well, very nice model, the make-up is spot on. If I had to criticise, I''d say the saturation on the reds are up a little high and the white orchid is a bit blown out. Otherwise, I like it and think it warrants a 7.</td>', 'I''ve always liked this theme, I shoot models often and I hope to do a shoot just like this sometime this year. The setting works well, very nice model, the make-up is spot on. If I had to criticise, I''d say the saturation on the reds are up a little high and the white orchid is a bit blown out. Otherwise, I like it and think it warrants a 7.', '2012-01-10 07:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6640762, 991085, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, nice and simple, good composition, I like the reflections and the overall golden tone. Nice work.</td>', 'I like this shot, nice and simple, good composition, I like the reflections and the overall golden tone. Nice work.', '2012-01-10 07:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6640764, 991330, 94265, '<td valign="top">The pink thing in the background is a bit distracting, I''d have moved it before taking the shot or desatruated it during editing but overall, I really like this, it made me chuckle. Nice and crisp, cool little characters; it totally says celebration to me, since the little man on top looking like he''s cheering, as well as the presence of cake. Cake is great for celebrating. Mmm..... cake.</td>', 'The pink thing in the background is a bit distracting, I''d have moved it before taking the shot or desatruated it during editing but overall, I really like this, it made me chuckle. Nice and crisp, cool little characters; it totally says celebration to me, since the little man on top looking like he''s cheering, as well as the presence of cake. Cake is great for celebrating. Mmm..... cake.', '2012-01-10 07:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6640765, 991331, 94265, '<td valign="top">Love the golden tones and that lovely bokeh. A nice sentiment also. I''d have perhaps had a more even amount of each of their wrists showing but that''s a small nitpick, just personal taste, the composition doesn''t suffer as it is. Could be a wee tad sharper overall but I do like this.</td>', 'Love the golden tones and that lovely bokeh. A nice sentiment also. I''d have perhaps had a more even amount of each of their wrists showing but that''s a small nitpick, just personal taste, the composition doesn''t suffer as it is. Could be a wee tad sharper overall but I do like this.', '2012-01-10 07:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6640766, 991302, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, you''ve got great focus on the miniature tree. Good exposure, some nice colours. I''m going to bump my vote up on this.</td>', 'Nice DOF, you''ve got great focus on the miniature tree. Good exposure, some nice colours. I''m going to bump my vote up on this.', '2012-01-10 07:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6640769, 990898, 94265, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t say celebration to me without the title and even then, I think it''s a bit of a stretch; it''s a lovely shot nonetheless, beautiful animal, a nice clear action capture.</td>', 'This doesn''t say celebration to me without the title and even then, I think it''s a bit of a stretch; it''s a lovely shot nonetheless, beautiful animal, a nice clear action capture.', '2012-01-10 07:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
