(6642869, 991314, 40391, '<td valign="top">Seriously! Is that an eye?  I was wondering how you managed to achieve the large bokeh with the sharp firework at the one location and then I read your title and had a closer look.  Actually, I had a further back look and to me this may be an image of an eye with the fireworks somehow reflected or the bokeh reflected in the eye.  OK, Im confused but also intrigued.  This image becomes more fascinating the longer I look. Nice.</td>', 'Seriously! Is that an eye?  I was wondering how you managed to achieve the large bokeh with the sharp firework at the one location and then I read your title and had a closer look.  Actually, I had a further back look and to me this may be an image of an eye with the fireworks somehow reflected or the bokeh reflected in the eye.  OK, Im confused but also intrigued.  This image becomes more fascinating the longer I look. Nice.', '2012-01-12 00:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642871, 991330, 40391, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the laugh.  A nice fun image.  Would have been worth ensuring the background didn''t play a role though.</td>', 'Thanks for the laugh.  A nice fun image.  Would have been worth ensuring the background didn''t play a role though.', '2012-01-12 00:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
