(6642874, 991085, 40391, '<td valign="top">The reflection of the fireworks in the glasses really makes this image.  Great idea and nicely done.  On a personal note I would love to see this in b&amp;w.  I know it would result in a lower vote but it is something I think may have created something really interesting for me.</td>', 'The reflection of the fireworks in the glasses really makes this image.  Great idea and nicely done.  On a personal note I would love to see this in b&w.  I know it would result in a lower vote but it is something I think may have created something really interesting for me.', '2012-01-12 01:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642876, 991261, 40391, '<td valign="top">Clever use of bokeh to simulate the champas.  I would love to see the bottle in better focus but this may not have been the sort of shot that could be redone to achieve the best results.</td>', 'Clever use of bokeh to simulate the champas.  I would love to see the bottle in better focus but this may not have been the sort of shot that could be redone to achieve the best results.', '2012-01-12 01:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642877, 990664, 40391, '<td valign="top">HA!  Before I saw your title I thought this cat is not in the partying frame of mind.  I love it when an image can capture human emotions in our pets.</td>', 'HA!  Before I saw your title I thought this cat is not in the partying frame of mind.  I love it when an image can capture human emotions in our pets.', '2012-01-12 01:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642879, 991296, 40391, '<td valign="top">Unless the flame goes out and, well, hes got it.<br/> <br/>This is a great capture telling a story I dont know the beginning or ending to but what is happening now.  If it was my shot I would probably crop most of the sky and soften the image and somehow increase the contrast to bring out the chaser.  Mind you, that might just turn out crap but right now that is how I would approach this image.</td>', 'Unless the flame goes out and, well, hes got it. This is a great capture telling a story I dont know the beginning or ending to but what is happening now.  If it was my shot I would probably crop most of the sky and soften the image and somehow increase the contrast to bring out the chaser.  Mind you, that might just turn out crap but right now that is how I would approach this image.', '2012-01-12 01:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
