(6643601, 991288, 129512, '<td valign="top">Wish the glasses had a tad more light. Not sure what the line in the backgrond is and its throwing me off just a bit. <br/> <br/>Besides for that, it''s a great shot!</td>', 'Wish the glasses had a tad more light. Not sure what the line in the backgrond is and its throwing me off just a bit.  Besides for that, it''s a great shot!', '2012-01-12 22:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643603, 991367, 129512, '<td valign="top">So true.</td>', 'So true.', '2012-01-12 22:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643605, 991369, 129512, '<td valign="top">Nicely Done. I wonder how many times it took to get that right!</td>', 'Nicely Done. I wonder how many times it took to get that right!', '2012-01-12 22:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643608, 991262, 129512, '<td valign="top">Nicely Done.</td>', 'Nicely Done.', '2012-01-12 22:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643609, 991274, 113142, '<td valign="top">I know I''m not the only one, but this is very blurry. Try higher ISO with faster shutter or, if available, longer shutter with second-curtain sync flash if trying to convey idea of motion and still maintain the boket of lights above.</td>', 'I know I''m not the only one, but this is very blurry. Try higher ISO with faster shutter or, if available, longer shutter with second-curtain sync flash if trying to convey idea of motion and still maintain the boket of lights above.', '2012-01-12 22:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643611, 991339, 100831, '<td valign="top">a lovely tapestry...</td>', 'a lovely tapestry...', '2012-01-12 22:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643612, 991302, 113142, '<td valign="top">Centerpiece is nice and sharp, but DOF a bit too shallow for this subject.</td>', 'Centerpiece is nice and sharp, but DOF a bit too shallow for this subject.', '2012-01-12 22:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643633, 991202, 113142, '<td valign="top">Amazing effect in the foreground, I feel a certain sense of forboding/gloom that I can''t quite put my finger on.</td>', 'Amazing effect in the foreground, I feel a certain sense of forboding/gloom that I can''t quite put my finger on.', '2012-01-12 23:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643634, 990931, 113142, '<td valign="top">Simple, snapshotty, yet certainly conveys the message.</td>', 'Simple, snapshotty, yet certainly conveys the message.', '2012-01-12 23:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643635, 991330, 113142, '<td valign="top">Just plain silly. That''s not a bad thing!</td>', 'Just plain silly. That''s not a bad thing!', '2012-01-12 23:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643636, 991380, 113142, '<td valign="top">Interesting high-key coupled with a silly title :)</td>', 'Interesting high-key coupled with a silly title :)', '2012-01-12 23:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643638, 990898, 113142, '<td valign="top">Excellent timing, subject, and execution</td>', 'Excellent timing, subject, and execution', '2012-01-12 23:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643641, 991247, 113142, '<td valign="top">Well composed, a bit of oversat on the reds. Isn''t that in October?</td>', 'Well composed, a bit of oversat on the reds. Isn''t that in October?', '2012-01-12 23:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643646, 990888, 113142, '<td valign="top">Normally, clowns disturb me. I think I might be ok around these guys, though. In small numbers.</td>', 'Normally, clowns disturb me. I think I might be ok around these guys, though. In small numbers.', '2012-01-12 23:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643648, 991300, 113142, '<td valign="top">Idyllic. I''m not sure why, but something feels like it is missing. Maybe a little wider to the right would balance it better, by fitting the house to the rule of thirds?</td>', 'Idyllic. I''m not sure why, but something feels like it is missing. Maybe a little wider to the right would balance it better, by fitting the house to the rule of thirds?', '2012-01-12 23:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643649, 990326, 113142, '<td valign="top">As per the title, I feel a bit disoriented (as I hope you intended)</td>', 'As per the title, I feel a bit disoriented (as I hope you intended)', '2012-01-12 23:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643652, 991367, 113142, '<td valign="top">This photo reminds me of the memorials that people leave at the scene of fatal traffic accidents. Along with the title, makes me wonder if you intended to make a sarcasticly pointed commentary. Seeing as interpretation is in the eye of the beholder, I''d say you did a great job with the exception of the bars in the upper left corner.</td>', 'This photo reminds me of the memorials that people leave at the scene of fatal traffic accidents. Along with the title, makes me wonder if you intended to make a sarcasticly pointed commentary. Seeing as interpretation is in the eye of the beholder, I''d say you did a great job with the exception of the bars in the upper left corner.', '2012-01-12 23:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643655, 991352, 113142, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. A bit of spilled champange on the drop would have made this complete, along with some burning of some highlights (particularly on the back drop).</td>', 'Nice concept. A bit of spilled champange on the drop would have made this complete, along with some burning of some highlights (particularly on the back drop).', '2012-01-12 23:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643656, 991323, 113142, '<td valign="top">Lighting is good (certainly better than I could have done!), but this scene would have been more believable if the bottles were actually opened.</td>', 'Lighting is good (certainly better than I could have done!), but this scene would have been more believable if the bottles were actually opened.', '2012-01-12 23:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643661, 991296, 113142, '<td valign="top">Is this one of those Thai rice paper lamp/balloons? That looks like fun! A bit OOF, however, and either shooting from a lower angle or allowing the balloon to achieve a higher elevation could have increased the impresssion of this balloon''s escape.</td>', 'Is this one of those Thai rice paper lamp/balloons? That looks like fun! A bit OOF, however, and either shooting from a lower angle or allowing the balloon to achieve a higher elevation could have increased the impresssion of this balloon''s escape.', '2012-01-12 23:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643663, 991177, 113142, '<td valign="top">This is interesting because I''m not sure what the intention of this image is: are we paying attention to the photographers and their obvious intensity, thus a commentary on what determines fleeting fame, or is the lady unintentionally OOF? One tells a story, the other is an accident, unfortulately I can''t settle on which this is supposed to be because neither intent is obvious. Of course, that could be my own shortcoming of interpretation.</td>', 'This is interesting because I''m not sure what the intention of this image is: are we paying attention to the photographers and their obvious intensity, thus a commentary on what determines fleeting fame, or is the lady unintentionally OOF? One tells a story, the other is an accident, unfortulately I can''t settle on which this is supposed to be because neither intent is obvious. Of course, that could be my own shortcoming of interpretation.', '2012-01-12 23:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643667, 991339, 113142, '<td valign="top">Though this does not necessarily apppeal to me, I can certainly believe that there is an appreciative audience for this image. Since I cannot decide to either vote per my own predilictions or for what I can see artistic value in despite my tastes, I''m afraid I must doom this to the median.</td>', 'Though this does not necessarily apppeal to me, I can certainly believe that there is an appreciative audience for this image. Since I cannot decide to either vote per my own predilictions or for what I can see artistic value in despite my tastes, I''m afraid I must doom this to the median.', '2012-01-12 23:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643669, 991144, 113142, '<td valign="top">The intensity of that gaze is palpable. Excellent lighting, while all elements of the image are easily visible the focus is immediate and at a level appropriate for the subject. Like opposite poles of a magnet, my eyes are drawn towards his.</td>', 'The intensity of that gaze is palpable. Excellent lighting, while all elements of the image are easily visible the focus is immediate and at a level appropriate for the subject. Like opposite poles of a magnet, my eyes are drawn towards his.', '2012-01-12 23:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643670, 991369, 113142, '<td valign="top">I hope you either got this on the first shot or had plenty of bottles. Either way, I''m sure you didn''t mind the extra excuse to open them!</td>', 'I hope you either got this on the first shot or had plenty of bottles. Either way, I''m sure you didn''t mind the extra excuse to open them!', '2012-01-12 23:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643672, 991085, 113142, '<td valign="top">Great control of the distance between the subjects in order to generate the proper image through the liquid while maintaining correct perspective for the contact point.</td>', 'Great control of the distance between the subjects in order to generate the proper image through the liquid while maintaining correct perspective for the contact point.', '2012-01-12 23:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643675, 991332, 113142, '<td valign="top">A slightly higher EV and shift of the frame to the right would have both balanced this picture, made it pop, and wouldn''t have chopped anybody prominent in half.</td>', 'A slightly higher EV and shift of the frame to the right would have both balanced this picture, made it pop, and wouldn''t have chopped anybody prominent in half.', '2012-01-12 23:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643679, 991364, 113142, '<td valign="top">Waaay too devious for a poker face, man! A bit of burn on those cards with a bit of dodge on your eyes and face would have brought my attention up to your face and away from the cards. This would have enhanced your concept of the "poker face," i.e. distracting me from the cards with your wily expression instead of being drawn towards the glare of the cards in your hand. Be careful with reflections of curved, glossy surfaces when using a flash or correct them PP.</td>', 'Waaay too devious for a poker face, man! A bit of burn on those cards with a bit of dodge on your eyes and face would have brought my attention up to your face and away from the cards. This would have enhanced your concept of the "poker face," i.e. distracting me from the cards with your wily expression instead of being drawn towards the glare of the cards in your hand. Be careful with reflections of curved, glossy surfaces when using a flash or correct them PP.', '2012-01-12 23:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643681, 991320, 113142, '<td valign="top">Your (that is you, right?) tiny self in comparison to the scale of this image as well as the hopeful rays of light through the clouds makes for an enjoyable picture. What luck, that the clouds allowed that bit of bright blue around your silouhette!</td>', 'Your (that is you, right?) tiny self in comparison to the scale of this image as well as the hopeful rays of light through the clouds makes for an enjoyable picture. What luck, that the clouds allowed that bit of bright blue around your silouhette!', '2012-01-12 23:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643685, 990579, 113142, '<td valign="top">The contrast of expressions evokes dischord instead of joy, the lovely smile contrasting with the cautious gaze as if distracted by an incoming danger.</td>', 'The contrast of expressions evokes dischord instead of joy, the lovely smile contrasting with the cautious gaze as if distracted by an incoming danger.', '2012-01-12 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643694, 990734, 12611, '<td valign="top">Congrats. Fantastic snag and editing!</td>', 'Congrats. Fantastic snag and editing!', '2012-01-13 00:03:28.000000', NULL, 0),
