(6644978, 991331, 117534, '<td valign="top">AH HA... Congrats on a lovely pix, I thought I commented on this but... Well here goes, What a lovely shot The boken background only helps to accent the celebration of the wedding!  (that''s excatly what I intended to say) LOL<br/> <br/>Beautiful Ring!! Ah did you get it back??</td>', 'AH HA... Congrats on a lovely pix, I thought I commented on this but... Well here goes, What a lovely shot The boken background only helps to accent the celebration of the wedding!  (that''s excatly what I intended to say) LOL Beautiful Ring!! Ah did you get it back??', '2012-01-14 17:44:55.000000', NULL, 0),
