(6645230, 991177, 136397, '<td valign="top">The lady in the middle is not the main subject but the two photographers are the one that telling the story of a celebrations.<br/>My aim is that these picture should be able to speak out on what usually happen on wedding''s day. The photograhers work very hard to make the occasions very memorable one by giving their best shots...<br/> <br/>Thank you for all the comments and I will continue to explore to make my pictures able to communicate to the viewers...<br/> <br/>Regards: askmie@yahoo.com</td>', 'The lady in the middle is not the main subject but the two photographers are the one that telling the story of a celebrations.My aim is that these picture should be able to speak out on what usually happen on wedding''s day. The photograhers work very hard to make the occasions very memorable one by giving their best shots... Thank you for all the comments and I will continue to explore to make my pictures able to communicate to the viewers... Regards: askmie@yahoo.com', '2012-01-15 02:33:40.000000', NULL, 0),
